==Trivia==
* No human characters are featured in this ending.
* This ending theme is also used in four [[Side story episodes|side story]] episodes. In the first two of these episodes, ''[[HS05|The Blue Badge of Courage]]'' and ''[[HS15|Putting the Air Back in Aerodactyl!]]'', {{p|Jynx}} was recolored with its updated appearance, but it is shown in its old appearance when the theme was used for the later episodes ''[[HS17|Those Darn Electabuzz!]]'' and ''[[HS18|The Search for the Legend]]''.
** The edited version of the ending with the recolored {{p|Jynx}} is also used during {{aniseries|GS}} on [[Prime Video]] in Japan.

